                            <span class="text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#9C6D45] bg-[#F2E5D7] px-2 py-0.5 rounded">Taller Digital</span>
                            <span class="text-[11px] text-[#8A7869] hidden sm:inline">• Proforma Técnica</span>
                        </div>
                        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-[#2E1F14] tracking-tight">
                            NUEVA <span class="text-[#9C5A2A] font-extrabold">COTIZACIÓN</span>
